menu "CPE SoftAP"

    config CPE_WIFI_COUNTRY_CODE
        string "Wi-Fi country code"
        default "CN"
        help
            ISO/IEC 3166-1 alpha-2 code passed to esp_wifi_set_country_code(),
            e.g. "CN", "US", "JP". Espressif's default "01" (world safe) only
            allows 2.4 GHz channels 1-11, so channels 12 and 13 require a
            country code that permits them. Supported codes are listed in
            esp_wifi.h.

    config SERVER_IP
        string "WiFi AP IP Address"
        default "192.168.4.1"
        help
            IPv4 address assigned to the SoftAP interface. The SoftAP SSID,
            password, channel, bandwidth and maximum station count are
            generated/validated at runtime by components/cpe_core (see the
            "CPE Core Configuration" menu); no fixed credential is compiled in.

endmenu
